<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S2" title="In Chow and chain polynomials of matroids are not log-concave" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">2 </span>Polynomial invariants and multichain counts</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S3" title="In Chow and chain polynomials of matroids are not log-concave" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">3 </span>Matroid operations: hyperplane coalescence, absorption</span></a></li>
